00:04:41,050 --> 00:04:44,100
That makes total sense. Then what happens once we have that list?

73
00:04:44,320 --> 00:04:45,480
Then you move to plan.

74
00:04:46,140 --> 00:04:51,360
This yields your target architecture, which is the blueprint of how all these systems will eventually connect.

75
00:04:51,420 --> 00:04:55,840
Okay. And the second part of plan produces a sequenced, costed roadmap,

76
00:04:56,460 --> 00:04:59,380
