77
00:04:59,420 --> 00:05:01,360
Which leads directly to the final phase, right?

78
00:05:01,540 --> 00:05:05,600
Yes. Execute and govern, resulting in a living, governed architecture.

79
00:05:06,040 --> 00:05:10,780
So it is not just a one-off IT project, it is a continuously managed ecosystem.

80
00:05:11,300 --> 00:05:19,620
